WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.960
May what you find here draw you near

2
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:22.400
To God, and he to you;

3
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:28.400
His Spirit light your eyes with truth

4
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:34.200
And guide you all life through.

5
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.880
May all his goodness fill your soul,

6
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.440
Your days be richly blest;

7
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:53.280
And, trusting him in all your ways,

8
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:59.240
May you find quiet rest.

9
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:07.380
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

10
00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:12.600
The love of God so true,

11
00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.820
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

12
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:24.680
Forever be with you.

13
00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:34.940
May God, who comforts all who mourn,

14
00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:39.220
Make whole what has been torn,

15
00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:46.480
And bind your wounds with tender hands

16
00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:51.260
Till hope again is born.

17
00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:57.840
The LORD in blessing keep you safe

18
00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:03.260
Within his arms of love,

19
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.580
Encircled there eternally

20
00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:15.220
By him who reigns above.

21
00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:24.500
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

22
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:29.340
The love of God so true,

23
00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.600
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

24
00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:41.620
Forever be with you.

25
00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:50.640
May his bright face upon you shine

26
00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:55.760
And gracious be to you;

27
00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:03.000
His favor be upon your life,

28
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:07.360
His peace your heart renew.

29
00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:14.140
May God, in whom you hope and trust,

30
00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:19.520
Make joy in you increase,

31
00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:26.960
And by his Spirit, hope and faith

32
00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:32.480
And good works never cease.

33
00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:41.220
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

34
00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:46.380
The love of God so true,

35
00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:50.420
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

36
00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:58.320
Forever be with you.

37
00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:07.620
The Lord enlarge your heart to love

38
00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.740
Each soul he shapes, like you;

39
00:04:12.740 --> 00:04:18.080
Through Jesus Christ, of Nazareth,

40
00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:24.580
May you be made anew;

41
00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:30.900
By his atoning grace be brought

42
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:36.680
With joy through heaven's door,

43
00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:42.260
To rest with him, and glorify

44
00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:48.800
His name forevermore.

45
00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:57.920
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

46
00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:02.980
The love of God so true,

47
00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:07.160
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

48
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:15.380
Forever be with you.

49
00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:25.380
In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth,

50
00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.700
Amen, amen, amen.
